@startuml
!include _seq-style.puml
title 3.1.5 ForgotPassword

actor "User" as U
boundary "Forgot password UI" as UI <<boundary>>
control "AuthController" as AC <<control>>
control "AuthService" as S <<service>>
entity "UserRepository" as UR <<entity>>

== Request OTP ==
U -> UI: enter registered email
activate UI
UI -> AC: POST /api/auth/forgot-password?email=
activate AC
AC -> S: sendOtpForPasswordReset(email)
activate S
S -> UR: findByUsernameIgnoreCaseOrEmailIgnoreCase(email)
activate UR
UR --> S: List~User~
deactivate UR
S -> S: generate OTP, save PasswordResetToken,\nEmailService.sendOtpEmail(...)
S --> AC: void / exception
deactivate S
AC --> UI: 200 "OTP sent" / 400
deactivate AC
UI --> U: prompt to check email
deactivate UI

@enduml
